  "synopsis": [
    {
      "langue": "en",
      "text": "Reknum Souls Adventure is an action, exploration and 2D platformer videogame for the NES, it is the latest installment in the REKNUM saga but one of the first in the REKNUM Timeline. What would you do to mend the past? Is facing your fears the solution to become stronger?… or perhaps the key to making amends? change or protect the future, what would you do to make up for an injury done to a loved one?… Let's look for answers in this classic platform adventure full of challenges, puzzles, combats and more!\r\n \r\nExplore the thematic levels, unlock new weapons, fight fearsome bosses inspired by classic gameplay, decipher the poetic words of the ancestors when you travel through the kingdom of Drissol and reach Cheri's final outcome.\r\n \r\nThe protagonist Cheri in Reknum Souls Adventure is not the same as the one we will find in Fantasy of Dreams or in Cheri's Dreamland. This Cheri is many years in the past, when the timeline has barely divided from the PLOIDS and the fantasy universe begins to be created.\r\n \r\nIn the kingdom of Drissol there was a great battle in the lust for power and it was where Cheri lost her family. After the war ended, she follows her desire to bring her family back based on village rumors, said rumors say that if she manages to get the 4 sacred souls she will be able to open a portal to the underworld and bring her family back … Here is when our adventure begins!"
    },
    {
      "langue": "fr",
      "text": "Dans le royaume de Drissol, il y a eu une grande bataille pour le pouvoir et c'est là que Cheri a perdu sa famille. Après la fin de la guerre, elle poursuit son désir de ramener sa famille en se basant sur des rumeurs de village, ces rumeurs disent que si elle parvient à obtenir les 4 âmes sacrées, elle pourra ouvrir un portail vers le monde souterrain et ramener sa famille... C'est ici que votre aventure commence !"
    },
    {
      "langue": "de",
      "text": "Im Königreich Drissol gab es einen großen Kampf um die Macht und dort verlor Cheri seine Familie. Nach dem Ende des Krieges setzt sie ihren Wunsch fort, ihre Familie auf der Grundlage von Dorfgerüchten zurückzubringen, diese Gerüchte sagen, dass sie, wenn es ihr gelingt, die 4 heiligen Seelen zu bekommen, ein Portal in die Unterwelt öffnen und ihre Familie zurückbringen kann... Hier beginnt Ihr Abenteuer!"
    }
  ],
